  "summary": {
    "pt": [
      "O Quatro de Paus fala de festa, harmonia e prosperidade.",
      "Ele representa a alegria que sai dos muros para celebrar.",
      "O foco dele é: viver com mais vigor sem se perder no tamanho da festa."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The Four of Wands speaks of celebration, harmony and prosperity.",
      "It stands for joy that steps out of the walls to celebrate.",
      "Its focus: living with more vigour without getting lost in the party."
    ]
  },
